# NPClaude speech: remarks. The format and every fact and word are described in basics.speech.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remarks made unprompted to a nearby player.

== idle ==
[idle_thought]
[idle_thought] [catchphrase]  {w=0.3}

